Well, I noticed that you were not wearing green.
嗯，我注意到你没穿绿色。

390
00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:37.920
No.
没有。

391
00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:42.180
Considering that your character thinks green is whorish, this day just must be very difficult
考虑到你的角色认为绿色很轻浮，这一天对你来说一定很难熬。

392
00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:42.660
for you.
对吧。

393
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.500
Oh, I have a whole thing about my character in St. Patrick's Day.
哦，关于我的角色在圣帕特里克节的表现，我有一大堆话要说。

394
00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:46.360
