to be annoyed that that was green.
因为那是绿色的而感到恼火。

402
00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.880
Oh, that would have been perfect.
噢，那本该是完美的。

403
00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:09.320
I know.
我知道。

404
00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.660
That's how they were going to reveal that.
他们原本打算那样揭露它。

405
00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:13.280
But instead, it ended up as just a little background moment.
但结果，它最终只是一个背景小插曲。

