00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:27.580
He's got surveillance, gaming, and business.
他有监控、游戏和办公设备。

410
00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.020
That's right.
没错。

411
00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:34.060
While Jim was off on his paternity leave, Dwight took his desk.
吉姆休陪产假的时候，德怀特占了他的办公桌。

412
00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.200
Now Jim is trying to figure out what he's going to do.
现在吉姆正在想办法解决这个问题。

