“他现在满脑子想的都是这个。”

436
00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.920
I love that Joe Bennett is going to arrive with her dogs.
我很喜欢乔·贝内特带着她的狗登场的桥段。

437
00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:51.380
I can't get enough of Joe Bennett.
我对乔·贝内特怎么看都看不够。

438
00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:53.200
I love Kathy Bates' performance.
我喜欢凯西·贝茨的表演。

439
00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:54.740
It is so good.
太棒了。

440
00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.600
I'm, like, crushing on it.
我简直迷上她了。

441
00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:59.260
Everything between her and Michael in this episode is perfection.
这一集中她和迈克尔之间的所有互动都是完美的。

442
00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:05.020
I wanted to point out the scene at 2 minutes, 5 seconds was actually longer in the shooting
我想指出的是，2分5秒的那场戏在拍摄剧本中其实更长，

443
00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:08.380
draft, and Joe goes around and compliments everyone.
乔走了一圈，夸奖了每个人。

444
00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:14.960
And I really felt like it set up that Michael storyline about him thinking Joe loves everybody
我真的觉得这为迈克尔认为乔爱每一个人，

445
00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.920
and, of course, he could go see her in Florida.
当然，他可以去佛罗里达见她的剧情线做了铺垫。

446
00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.100
I thought we should hear it.
我觉得我们应该听听那段。

447
00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:21.340
Oh, Angela, I love that sweater.
“噢，安吉拉，我喜欢那件毛衣。”

