470
00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.470
A lump of coal.
一块煤。

471
00:20:15.870 --> 00:20:16.530
Yes.
没错。

472
00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:20.070
From the Anthracite Heritage Museum.
来自无烟煤遗产博物馆。

473
00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:22.450
You guys, we've shared about the museum before.
