1146
00:49:35.160 --> 00:49:35.210
Yes.
没错。

1147
00:49:35.340 --> 00:49:44.840
So this one night, I heard that the cast of Saturday Night Live was going to be at the party, and I wanted to go so badly.
有一天晚上，我听说《周六夜现场》的剧组成员会来派对，我特别想去。

1148
00:49:45.000 --> 00:49:46.560
