1609
01:05:43.740 --> 01:05:45.480
What was Rain doing in his real life
雷恩当时在现实生活中

1610
01:05:45.480 --> 01:05:46.000
at this time?
是在干什么？

1611
01:05:46.100 --> 01:05:50.640
His hair is way longer than Dwight's hair normally is, and they used a little flat iron,
他的头发比德怀特平时的头发长多了，他们用了个小直板夹，

1612
01:05:50.740 --> 01:05:57.140
but they clearly had more hair to flat iron, and it's laying on top of his forehead like these long
但显然有更多的头发要夹，它们就那样铺在他额头上，像这种长长的、

1613
01:05:57.140 --> 01:05:58.160
wispy bangs.
细碎的刘海。

1614
01:05:58.380 --> 01:05:59.720
I was cracking up.
我当时笑得不行。

1615
01:05:59.880 --> 01:06:00.480
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1616
01:06:00.540 --> 01:06:01.800
I did not notice this.
我都没注意到这个。

1617
01:06:01.940 --> 01:06:02.940
Wait, I took a picture.
等等，我拍了张照片。

1618
01:06:03.920 --> 01:06:05.220
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1619
01:06:05.420 --> 01:06:10.760
Please, please look at his poofy, long bangs, flat ironed hair.
请一定要看看他那蓬松、长长的刘海，还有那夹直的头发。

1620
01:06:11.320 --> 01:06:13.060
Oh, his hair is so long.
噢，他的头发太长了。

1621
01:06:13.300 --> 01:06:13.520
Yeah.
是啊。

1622
01:06:13.880 --> 01:06:15.160
I'm going to put it in stories.
我要把它发到快拍里。

1623
01:06:15.860 --> 01:06:18.460
So, that's what I was looking at in the scene.
所以，那一幕里我一直在看这个。

1624
01:06:19.280 --> 01:06:23.340
Jim is going to call Joe Bennett and say he has a meeting.
吉姆要打电话给乔·贝内特，说他有个会议。

1625
01:06:23.540 --> 01:06:25.640
He gets out, and now Dwight actually can't
他脱身了，现在德怀特实际上没法

1626
01:06:25.640 --> 01:06:30.380
