所以我终于可以安心购物了。

1677
01:08:27.330 --> 01:08:29.250
I'm scared of mall tramplings.
我害怕商场里发生踩踏事件。

1678
01:08:29.810 --> 01:08:30.310
Okay.
好吧。

1679
01:08:31.550 --> 01:08:33.090
And here's the other one.
这是另一个。

1680
01:08:33.090 --> 01:08:37.450
You tell me if there's a little bit of writer's sass, Angela Martin says.
你来评评看有没有编剧的小心思，安吉拉·马丁说。

1681
01:08:38.010 --> 01:08:39.170
I'm not afraid of hard
我不怕辛苦

1682
01:08:39.170 --> 01:08:39.510
work.
工作。

1683
01:08:39.690 --> 01:08:44.430
Do you know what hard work it is to dye my hair platinum blonde each month?
你知道每个月把头发染成白金色有多辛苦吗？

1684
01:08:44.670 --> 01:08:45.910
I mean, come on.
我是说，拜托。

1685
01:08:46.190 --> 01:08:49.830
I'm closing in on 40, but my hair looks like Christina Aguilera.
我快四十岁了，但我的头发看起来像克里斯蒂娜·阿奎莱拉。

1686
01:08:50.530 --> 01:08:51.010
Oh.
噢。

1687
01:08:51.330 --> 01:08:51.750
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1688
01:08:51.950 --> 01:08:52.650
I would say,
我会说，

1689
01:08:52.670 --> 01:08:57.190
I would say someone in the writer's room had some thoughts on my hair color.
我会说编剧室里有人对我的发色有意见。

1690
01:08:57.310 --> 01:08:58.310
I guess so.
我想也是。

1691
01:08:58.310 --> 01:08:58.611
Oh.
噢。

1692
01:08:58.611 --> 01:09:03.635
So now, Joe is prepping to go back to Tallahassee.
现在，乔正准备回塔拉哈西。

1693
01:09:03.635 --> 01:09:05.443
I loved this part.
我喜欢这一段。

1694
01:09:05.443 --> 01:09:06.950
She tells Gabe,
她告诉盖博，

1695
01:09:07.130 --> 01:09:10.270
ship all her things because she has had it with Homeland Security.
把她的东西都寄走，因为她受够了国土安全部。

1696
01:09:11.090 --> 01:09:12.430
But you know what, Angela?
但你知道吗，安吉拉？

1697
01:09:12.970 --> 01:09:15.950
That is a sneaky celebrity trick.
那是一个狡猾的名人把戏。

1698
01:09:16.190 --> 01:09:17.390
Do you know about this trick?
你知道这个把戏吗？

1699
01:09:17.630 --> 01:09:18.070
No.
不知道。

1700
01:09:18.370 --> 01:09:20.070
They ship their clothes
他们把衣服寄走

1701
01:09:20.070 --> 01:09:26.190
