送到目的地，这样他们下飞机后，就能直接从机场溜走了。

1702
01:09:26.190 --> 01:09:27.230
Did you know that?
你知道吗？

1703
01:09:27.390 --> 01:09:28.190
Someone told me that.
有人告诉过我。

1704
01:09:28.470 --> 01:09:28.590
No.
不知道。

1705
01:09:28.850 --> 01:09:31.710
Someone said that they ship their clothes FedEx.
有人说他们把衣服用联邦快递寄过去。

1706
01:09:31.830 --> 01:09:32.050
I could
我可

1707
01:09:32.050 --> 01:09:32.690
never do it.
绝对做不到。

1708
01:09:32.770 --> 01:09:36.030
What if the package got lost and then you got where you're going and you don't have any
万一包裹丢了，等你到了目的地，却发现一件

1709
01:09:36.030 --> 01:09:36.430
clothes?
衣服都没有，那怎么办？

1710
01:09:36.930 --> 01:09:37.330
Yeah.
是啊。

1711
01:09:37.470 --> 01:09:38.730
And then isn't everything wrinkled?
而且那样衣服不会皱吗？

1712
01:09:38.830 --> 01:09:40.730
But I guess it gets wrinkled in your suitcase too.
不过我想放在行李箱里也会皱的。

1713
01:09:41.090 --> 01:09:41.290
Yeah.
是啊。

1714
01:09:41.830 --> 01:09:42.890
That's a thing though.
但这确实是个办法。

1715
01:09:43.510 --> 01:09:45.070
Joe is doing the sneaky trick.
乔在耍小聪明。

1716
01:09:45.890 --> 01:09:48.990
After speaking with Gabe about how late
在和盖博谈过乔

1717
01:09:48.990 --> 01:09:56.390
Joe usually works, Michael has decided he's going to take matters into his own hands and he's going to
通常工作到多晚之后，迈克尔决定亲自出马，他要

1718
01:09:56.390 --> 01:10:01.530
walk in to Joe Bennett and he is going to say that he is pleased with his employees' performance today
走进乔·贝内特的办公室，说他对员工今天的表现很满意，

1719
01:10:01.530 --> 01:10:03.530
and he's going to send them home for the night.
然后让他们提前下班回家。

1720
01:10:04.150 --> 01:10:06.590
And by the way, he's also canceled his trips to
顺便说一下，他还取消了去

1721
01:10:06.590 --> 01:10:07.270
Tallahassee.
塔拉哈西的行程。

1722
01:10:07.450 --> 01:10:11.030
So, you know, he looks forward to their working relationship.
所以，你知道的，他很期待他们的工作关系。

1723
01:10:11.790 --> 01:10:12.650
The end.
结束。

1724
01:10:12.650 --> 01:10:19.270
And I think for once, Joe respects Michael in a moment because he stood up for his workers.
我觉得乔难得地尊重了迈克尔一次，因为他为员工挺身而出。

1725
01:10:19.730 --> 01:10:20.470
He did.
他确实做了。

1726
01:10:20.690 --> 01:10:21.230
He did.
他确实做了。

1727
01:10:21.290 --> 01:10:24.110
And she says, I look forward to that too.
她说，我也很期待。

1728
01:10:24.630 --> 01:10:29.750
And then the whole gang gets to go out to the bar and they like Michael.
然后大家一起去酒吧，他们开始喜欢迈克尔了。

1729
01:10:30.070 --> 01:10:31.290
It's really this nice
这真的是一个

1730
01:10:31.290 --> 01:10:35.170
moment where, you know, they're happy to be out at a bar with Michael.
美好的时刻，你知道，他们很高兴能和迈克尔一起在酒吧里。

1731
01:10:35.410 --> 01:10:36.710
He saved the night.
他拯救了那个夜晚。

1732
01:10:37.570 --> 01:10:41.710
Andy and Aaron's date, if you can call it a date, has come to an end.
安迪和亚伦的约会，如果那能叫约会的话，已经结束了。

1733
01:10:41.710 --> 01:10:44.790
And it looks like they're about to kiss.
看起来他们正要接吻。

1734
01:10:45.190 --> 01:10:47.350
But then, of course, Reed pops in.
但当然，里德突然冒了出来。

1735
01:10:47.490 --> 01:10:47.690
Yep.
没错。

1736
01:10:48.290 --> 01:10:52.870
And Aaron gives Andy a very long, lingering kiss on the cheek.
亚伦在安迪脸颊上留下了一个非常漫长、缠绵的吻。

1737
01:10:53.210 --> 01:10:54.290
It's very sweet.
非常甜蜜。

1738
01:10:54.610 --> 01:10:54.970
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1739
01:10:55.250 --> 01:10:59.690
Pretty much everyone is having a good night in the end.
最后几乎每个人都度过了一个美好的夜晚。

1740
01:10:59.790 --> 01:11:00.450
In the end.
最后。

1741
01:11:00.650 --> 01:11:00.850
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1742
01:11:01.310 --> 01:11:06.550
Well, there is a tag, Jenna, where Dwight arrives to find Jim sitting atop a three-desk pile
对了，珍娜，还有一个彩蛋，德怀特赶到时发现吉姆坐在三张桌子堆成的高塔上，

1743
01:11:06.550 --> 01:11:08.970
