他管这叫“四重桌”。

1744
01:11:09.090 --> 01:11:09.310
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1745
01:11:09.310 --> 01:11:09.550
Right?
对吧？

1746
01:11:09.810 --> 01:11:10.190
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1747
01:11:10.770 --> 01:11:12.530
There was an alt for the scene.
这场戏还有一个备选方案。

1748
01:11:12.750 --> 01:11:13.150
Oh.
哦。

1749
01:11:13.830 --> 01:11:15.570
In the shooting draft, it says,
在拍摄剧本里写着，

1750
01:11:16.190 --> 01:11:19.890
Jim has taken Dwight's mega-desk configuration and rearranged it.
吉姆把德怀特的“超级桌”结构重新排列组合了。

1751
01:11:20.030 --> 01:11:22.350
Three desks stacked on top of each other.
三张桌子摞在一起。

1752
01:11:22.510 --> 01:11:25.730
Each desk still has all its equipment, computer, phone, etc.
每张桌子上还放着所有的设备，电脑、电话等等。

1753
01:11:26.090 --> 01:11:28.870
There is a stepladder set up as a chair.
还有一把人字梯被当作椅子用。

1754
01:11:29.070 --> 01:11:34.070
And Jim is standing on the stepladder working at the top-level desk when Dwight enters.
吉姆正站在梯子上在最顶层的桌子办公，这时德怀特进来了。

1755
01:11:34.670 --> 01:11:36.550
Dwight says, what the hell is this?
德怀特说，这到底是什么鬼？

1756
01:11:36.690 --> 01:11:37.730
Where's mega-desk?
超级桌子去哪了？

1757
01:11:38.550 --> 01:11:43.190
Jim says, gone, replaced by something better, tower-desk.
吉姆说，没了，被更好的东西取代了，塔式桌。

1758
01:11:43.510 --> 01:11:45.350
Ooh, tower-desk.
噢，塔式桌。

1759
01:11:45.490 --> 01:11:48.970
And Dwight has this talking head where he's like, well, now I want a tower-desk.
然后德怀特有个采访镜头，他说，好吧，现在我也想要个塔式桌。

1760
01:11:49.090 --> 01:11:50.390
I'm going to make one at home.
我要在家里做一个。

1761
01:11:50.530 --> 01:11:51.050
Four levels.
四层。

1762
01:11:51.210 --> 01:11:52.150
I have a silo.
我有个粮仓。

1763
01:11:52.310 --> 01:11:53.450
I can have five levels.
我可以做五层。

1764
01:11:53.450 --> 01:11:54.410
Wow.
哇。

1765
01:11:54.670 --> 01:12:00.730
So that was the alternate, but instead we ended up with quad desk and a teeny tiny little desk
所以那本来是备选方案，但最后我们还是用了四层桌，还在它们下面给德怀特留了个

1766
01:12:00.730 --> 01:12:02.690
underneath them all for Dwight.
极小的桌子。

1767
01:12:02.870 --> 01:12:03.170
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1768
01:12:03.810 --> 01:12:04.270
Aw.
噢。

1769
01:12:04.650 --> 01:12:06.810
You guys, that was St. Patrick's Day.
伙计们，那是圣帕特里克节。

1770
01:12:06.910 --> 01:12:07.550
It was.
确实是。

1771
01:12:07.990 --> 01:12:10.830
Thanks for celebrating this episode with us.
感谢大家和我们一起庆祝这一集。

1772
